                                    <div class="entry-content">

                                        <p>This special edition offers an overview of three key solar markets, as well as a deep dive into the environment for solar in Europe and MENA regions.</p>
<p>The special publication includes a close look at Huawei's latest FusionSolar brand and solutions, including advances in the areas of grid-forming and safety for all scenarios. The company’s vision for a clean future powered by solar is detailed in insightful interviews and other informed articles.</p>
<p>Interviews with key customers and partners of Huawei lend additional insights into the technological benefits afforded by FusionSolar products in countries including South Africa, Thailand, Nigeria, France, and Brazil, with a special look at the use of solar projects to help create jobs in neighboring communities.</p>
<p><strong><a href="https://www.flipsnack.com/pvmagazinegroup/huawei-special-edition-2023/full-view.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Click here</a> or below to view and read the entire Huawei 2023 Corporate Edition online or <a href="https://www.pv-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/pvmag-HuaweiSE2023-FS.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">download the PDF</a>. </strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="https://www.flipsnack.com/pvmagazinegroup/huawei-special-edition-2023/full-view.html"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="225744" data-permalink="https://www.pv-magazine.com/magazine-archive/huawei-special-edition-2023/flipsnack-image/" data-orig-file="https://www.pv-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Flipsnack-image.jpg" data-orig-size="1219,664" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="Huawei SE 2023 Flipsnack-image" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://www.pv-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Flipsnack-image-600x327.jpg" data-large-file="https://www.pv-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Flipsnack-image-1200x654.jpg" tabindex="0" role="button" class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-225744" src="https://www.pv-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Flipsnack-image-600x327.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="327" srcset="https://www.pv-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Flipsnack-image-600x327.jpg 600w, https://www.pv-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Flipsnack-image-1200x654.jpg 1200w, https://www.pv-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Flipsnack-image-768x418.jpg 768w, https://www.pv-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Flipsnack-image.jpg 1219w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></a></p>
